{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_camEWMKV4koCIbnXCfsO4027","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/xuning/IdeaProjects/skills/skills/okf-knowledge-read/test-fixture/flows/c2c-message-send.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5242faff-5238-48b8-bebb-13e618bb6f5e","uuid":"cee125ce-71b7-4c58-a08f-58eb0836bf33","timestamp":"2026-07-19T15:22:07.527Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/Users/xuning/IdeaProjects/skills/skills/okf-knowledge-read/test-fixture/flows/c2c-message-send.md","oldString":"## 实现断言\n\n| 断言内容 | 验证状态 | 代码证据位置 |\n|----------|----------|--------------|\n| 消息写入 MySQL 后返回 messageId | 已验证 | message-service/handler.go:42 |\n| 离线消息在用户重连后批量推送 | 已验证 | im-gateway/reconnect.go:78 |\n\n## 引用","newString":"## 实现断言\n\n| 断言内容 | 验证状态 | 代码证据位置 |\n|----------|----------|--------------|\n| 消息写入 MySQL 后返回 messageId | 已验证 | message-service/handler.go:42 |\n| 离线消息在用户重连后批量推送 | 已验证 | im-gateway/reconnect.go:78 |\n\n## 相关文档\n\n- [IM Gateway](../services/im-gateway/overview.md) — 消息接入网关服务\n- [User](../domain/entities/user.md) — 消息发送和接收方实体\n- [Message](../domain/entities/message.md) — 消息实体定义\n- [MySQL](../infrastructure/mysql.md) — 消息持久化存储\n\n## 引用","originalFile":"---\ntype: DataFlow\ntitle: C2C Message Send\ndescription: C2C 单聊消息发送完整链路：客户端 → IM Gateway → 消息服务 → 存储 → 推送\ntags: [c2c, message, flow]\ntimestamp: 2026-07-19T00:00:00+08:00\n---\n\nC2C 单聊消息发送是 IM 系统最核心的业务链路，涉及消息的发送、存储、推送全流程。\n\n## 完整链路\n\n```\nClient(A) → IM Gateway → Message Service → MySQL(存储) → IM Gateway → Client(B)\n                                                          ↓\n                                                     Push Service\n```\n\n## 各环节职责\n\n| 环节编号 | 服务 | 关键操作 |\n|----------|------|----------|\n| 1 | IM Gateway | 接收客户端 WebSocket 消息，验证连接有效性 |\n| 2 | Message Service | 校验消息内容，生成 messageId，写入 MySQL |\n| 3 | IM Gateway | 查询目标用户连接状态，推送消息或存储为离线消息 |\n\n## 投递语义\n\n- 采用 At-Least-Once 投递语义\n- 客户端通过 messageId 去重\n- 发送失败时自动重试 3 次\n\n## 实现断言\n\n| 断言内容 | 验证状态 | 代码证据位置 |\n|----------|----------|--------------|\n| 消息写入 MySQL 后返回 messageId | 已验证 | message-service/handler.go:42 |\n| 离线消息在用户重连后批量推送 | 已验证 | im-gateway/reconnect.go:78 |\n\n## 引用\n\n[1] [IM 消息链路设计](https://example.com/message-flow)\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":37,"oldLines":6,"newStart":37,"newLines":13,"lines":[" | 消息写入 MySQL 后返回 messageId | 已验证 | message-service/handler.go:42 |"," | 离线消息在用户重连后批量推送 | 已验证 | im-gateway/reconnect.go:78 |"," ","+## 相关文档","+","+- [IM Gateway](../services/im-gateway/overview.md) — 消息接入网关服务","+- [User](../domain/entities/user.md) — 消息发送和接收方实体","+- [Message](../domain/entities/message.md) — 消息实体定义","+- [MySQL](../infrastructure/mysql.md) — 消息持久化存储","+"," ## 引用"," "," [1] [IM 消息链路设计](https://example.com/message-flow)"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
